<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sampo August sales rise.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sampo August sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Sampo Corp said on Monday its sales revenue in August rose 6.07 percent to T$1.149 billion against the same period last year.</p>
<p>Its combined sales for the first eight months were up 0.87 percent to T$13.265 billion from the corresponding period in 1995, Sampo said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company did not give sales figures for 1995.</p>
<p>Sampo is one of Taiwan's major electronic appliance manufacturers.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
